# Test: Macro expansion error provenance
#
# This test verifies that errors during macro expansion include provenance showing
# which macro was expanding and at which call site.

# Test case: A macro that intentionally errors during expansion
[macro will-error [let arg]
  [/ 1 0]]  # Division by zero in transformer body

# This produces an error with macro provenance context
[will-error dummy]
=== error
[E080] macro 'will-error' expansion result failed to evaluate: /: division by zero (defined at 10:1-10:19)
  in [/ ...] at 7:3-7:10
  in macro:will-error at 10:1-10:19
  in in expansion of `will-error` at 10:1-10:19
